From 323e3b68ee0b76ad5ae448aaafb5ce34719e881c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: caeliglow-validate <caeliglow@local>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:38:33 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] caeliglow: v1.6 launcher, power menu, motion, logo and icon
 polish

Adds the whole CaeliGlow v1.6 layer on top of the brightness fix, all
additive and reversible, delivered through the patch series.

Launcher
- Attached (edge-docked) by default, with a floating/attached setting.
- Independent length and width controls; card outlines and layout polish.

Power menu
- Borderless pill; dedicated Settings subsection for presentation,
  concavity, width, icon size and gap.
- Trigger/open direction derived from the pill's left/right position.

Motion
- Ten fluid morph presets (classic..calm) plus a shell-wide reduced-motion
  switch, wired into Settings.

Branding and icons
- New attached logo assets wired into the panel and About card; polished
  About card.
- Cohesive outlined icon house style (drop stray filled glyphs, fix the
  unresolved file-lock glyph), restrained glyph-button hover lift that
  snaps under reduced motion, and a glyph_registry guard test.

Settings persistence for every new key is covered by
config_schema_roundtrip; icon integrity by the new glyph_registry test.
